            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Merchant; Entrancement, Wealthy; Protection (Carles Magnus), Temporal Influence (coastal criminals and smugglers); Enemies (Sheriff of Southampton), Greater Malediction (Plagued by Infernal Entities); Busybody, Small Frame"
            ^"Personality Traits" STRING "Gregarious +3, Unforgiving +2, Determined +1"
